      "text": "Start here. Every screen is one artboard at 1440×1000. The left nav is unfoldingWord's real Johnny.Decimal index — click an area heading in the prototype to open its area home, where that area's projects and meetings live.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-page-2",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "Money. Worth testing: posting a draft journal entry, settling lines and hitting the policy flag in Expense review, and the Program financials screen — which is the Budget Report and Revenue Projection dashboards re-hosted over live ledger data.",
      "page": "page-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-page-3",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "Fundraising and strategy. Try the hard vs soft_inclusive switch on the contact record, and pushing a story above its sensitivity level in Story Bank.",
      "page": "page-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-page-4",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "Field and product. Products are a plane of their own: one owning category, but serving several programs. Development filters by product.",
      "page": "page-4"
    },
